{"version":1,"content":"<p>「億萬駙馬」伍富橋昨天（14日）出席活動時，自揭已做爸爸，太太梁兆楹（Shirley）一索得男，不過B仔Julian提早近1個月出世，伍富橋還表示有陪太太入產房兼親手剪臍帶。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T09:02:27.491889+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:26:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T14:57:46.160908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:38.183206+00:00","content_hash":"a65043f6926cb0a3e6b35bee1317d9c645f3b8ee7db7a857139c0ddde02adf17","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}